{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2023-05-09 17:55:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA ANNOUNCES NOTIONAL ISHARES ETF DISTRIBUTIONS', 'text': 'TORONTO, MAY 09, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (“BLACKROCK”) (NYSE:BLK) TODAY ANNOUNCES NOTIONAL NON-CASH REINVESTED DISTRIBUTIONS (EACH, A “NOTIONAL DISTRIBUTION”) FOR EACH OF THE ISHARES ESG MSCI CANADA LEADERS INDEX ETF AND ISHARES ESG MSCI EAFE LEADERS INDEX ETF (EACH, AN “ISHARES ETF”).'}